Mock hub links in tests: use **`PublicAgentChannelHubLinkViewModel`** and **`icons.*.name`** (`TikTok`, not `Tiktok`).

## PR checklist (ecosystem touch)

- [ ] Host slug registered in **`AGENT_HOST_ECOSYSTEM_BY_SLUG`** only when product claims a first-class or sibling relationship
- [ ] **`/channels/{slug}`** and **`/agents/{host}`** smoke: fourth WhoIsFor card, integration grid order, no duplicate FAQ titles
- [ ] **`pnpm exec vitest run`** on `ecosystems.test.ts` and channel grid copy tests
- [ ] Neutral vendor copy (**source-project-neutrality**)

